# {{ project_name }}

A web application built with [Basis](https://github.com/bassio/basis) — the
full-stack Python reactive web framework. Scaffolded by `basis init`.

## Getting Started

```bash
# Install dependencies
uv sync

# Start the development server (live HMR on by default)
basis dev
```

Open http://127.0.0.1:8000 — the shell renders an SSR page at `/` with a small
reactive demo (counter + store list{% if example_plugin %} + a plugin-contributed
region view{% endif %}).

## Project Structure

```
src/{{ slug }}/
├── __init__.py          # App setup: Basis() + bootstrap() + serve("/")(HomePage)
├── components/          # UI components — the shell frame + chrome parts
│   ├── page.py          # HomePage(Page) — the "/" route shell
│   └── app_container.py # Root component (edit freely)
├── stores/              # Global stores (auto-discovered) — incl. the theme seed
├── plugins/             # Auto-discovered plugins
└── static/
    └── app.css          # App-wide override stylesheet (linked via HomePage)
```
